        "original_id": "0b42767f-1d1d-5692-89a5-cf9fc9abad53",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Miles Kane, Carl Barât, Pete Doherty\n- Bands: The Libertines, The Last Shadow Puppets\n- Songs/Albums: \"Don't Forget Who You Are\"\n- Places: London, United Kingdom\n\nFacts:\n- The Libertines are an English rock band formed in London in 1997 by frontmen Carl Barât and Pete Doherty.\n- Miles Peter Kane was born on 17 March 1986 and is an English musician.\n- Miles Kane is best known as a solo artist and as the co-frontman of the Last Shadow Puppets.\n- \"Don't Forget Who You Are\" is a song by Miles Kane from his second studio album of the same name.\n- \"Don't Forget Who You Are\" was released as a digital download in the United Kingdom on 3 June 2013.",
